{"version":1,"content":"<p>46歲日本女星廣末涼子發生超速駕駛肇事及傷人事件後，被診斷患上躁鬱症與甲狀腺機能亢進停工一年。</p><p>她於今年4月復工藝能界後，曾表示今後會放慢腳步，循序漸進做好自己的工作。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;她於今年7月舉行3場演唱會及上</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:27:21.630553+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:03:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T03:20:44.273143+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T03:20:44.273143+00:00","content_hash":"2551303d75a73a848f55c12c95f9c9eaaa8b01cfebc083fd0222b97764d942c8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}